<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34757" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">per-cūro</span></b> , āvi,
			ātum, 1, v. a., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to heal thoroughly</i>, <i>cure completely</i> (perh. not anteAug.).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">percurato vulnere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					21, 57</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Curt. 4, 6, 21</span></i>; <i><span class="en">7, 6, 23</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tarde percurabitur,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					6, 12, 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">donec strumae percurentur,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					32, 8, 28, § 88</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">desperata a medicis vitia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Q. N. 3, 1, 3</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mentem aegram,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Ep. 94, 13</span></i>
			.</div>
